Malis and her family go to the park. There is a big fountain in the middle. Joggers run along the footpath. Grandma sits near the flower bed. Malis plays on the climbing frame and feeds the ducks at the duck pond. They have lunch at a picnic table and put their rubbish in the litter bin.

